Dear Refugee Rights OrgTeam,

I hope this message finds you well.

My name is Rohullah Rahmani, and I am reaching out to seek your support. I
served with the Afghan government during the NATO and U.S. presence in
Afghanistan, contributing to efforts aimed at rebuilding our nation.
Unfortunately, since the government's collapse, I have faced significant
challenges, including threats to my safety and limited opportunities to
live and work freely.

I am seeking assistance to find a pathway to safety and stability, possibly
through resettlement programs or humanitarian parole. I have gathered
documentation of my service and am prepared to provide any additional
information required.

I understand the demands on your organization are immense, but any guidance
or support you can offer would be deeply appreciated. Your assistance could
be a pivotal step toward a safer and more hopeful future for me.

Thank you for considering my request.

Warm regards,

Rohullah Rahmani
+93764675793

